cff-version: 1.2.0
title: panelaudit
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software and the
  accompanying paper.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Abhimanyu
    family-names: R B
    email: abhi@anukritiai.com
    affiliation: Anukriti AI
repository-code: "https://github.com/AnukritiAi-hq/panelaudit"
abstract: >-
  Panel-first pharmacogenomic audit. Enumerates every diplotype expressible
  from CPIC allele definitions, projects each onto a candidate genotyping
  panel, and classifies the result as CORRECT, NO_CALL or WRONG against the
  phenotype CPIC assigns. Weights by published per-population allele
  frequency under Hardy-Weinberg, and ranks which locus to add next by the
  carrier burden it recovers. Needs no cohort and no sequencing run.
keywords:
  - pharmacogenomics
  - CPIC
  - genotyping panel
  - health equity
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-29"
